  "prefLabel": "Ath 102.08 Physician",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ath 102.08 \"Physician\" means a doctor of medicine or a doctor of osteopathy who holds a current license to practice from any state or in Canada.\n\nSource. #9872, eff 2-24-11; ss by #12946, eff 12-20-19 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ath 100); ss by #14373, eff 9-19-25",
